  "_comment": "Phrase -> table shortlist hints for lexical retrieval. Matching is plain substring containment against the lowercased question, which is deliberate: Arabic attaches its definite article and prepositions directly to the word (الإيجار, للشقق), so a word-boundary match would miss them. Retrieval is recall-oriented — an extra table in the prompt is cheap, a missing one is not. Bare metric words (متوسط, إجمالي, أعلى, average, total) are deliberately absent: they appear in nearly every question and name no table, so they only add a constant to every fact table's score.",
